{"headword":"נָסָה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. Pi. test, try (</strong>NH <em>id.</em>, Pi.; 𝔗 Pa. <span dir=\"rtl\">נַסִּי</span>; Syriac Pa. <span dir=\"rtl\">ܢܰܣܺܝ</span>; cf. Ethiopic መንሱት <em>temptation</em><strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִסָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:34\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.34\">Dt 4:34</a> + 3 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִסָּהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:25\" href=\"/Exodus.15.25\">Ex 15:25</a>; 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִסְּתָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:56\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.56\">Dt 28:56</a>; 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִסִּיתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:23\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.23\">Ec 7:23</a>, + 4 times Pf.; Impf. 3 ms. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְנַסֵּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:14\" href=\"/Daniel.1.14\">Dn 1:14</a>; 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲנְסֶּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:39\" href=\"/Judges.6.39\">Ju 6:39</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲנַסְּכָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 2:2\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.2.2\">Ec 2:2</a>; 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְנַסּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:22\" href=\"/Numbers.14.22\">Nu 14:22</a>; 2 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּנַסּ֑וּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 17:2\" href=\"/Exodus.17.2\">Ex 17:2</a>, + 7 times Impf.; Imv. <span dir=\"rtl\">נַס</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:12\" href=\"/Daniel.1.12\">Dn 1:12</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נַסֵּנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 26:2\" href=\"/Psalms.26.2\">ψ 26:2</a>; Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">נַסּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 20:17\" href=\"/Exodus.20.17\">Ex 20:20</a>, + 8 times Inf.; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְנַסֶּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 13:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.13.4\">Dt 13:4</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>test, try</em> (syn. <span dir=\"rtl\">בחן</span>), abs. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:39\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.39\">1 S 17:39</a> (equipment); c. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span> <a data-re