es.32.31\">2 Ch 32:31</a>; psalmist <a data-ref=\"Psalms 26:2\" href=\"/Psalms.26.2\">ψ 26:2</a>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Isr. <em>tests</em>, or <em>tries</em> God: <a data-ref=\"Exodus 17:2\" href=\"/Exodus.17.2\">Ex 17:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 17:7\" href=\"/Exodus.17.7\">7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:22\" href=\"/Numbers.14.22\">Nu 14:22</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 6:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.6.16\">Dt 6:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:18\" href=\"/Psalms.78.18\">ψ 78:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:41\" href=\"/Psalms.78.41\">41</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:56\" href=\"/Psalms.78.56\">56</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 95:9\" href=\"/Psalms.95.9\">95:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:14\" href=\"/Psalms.106.14\">106:14</a>; so Ahaz, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.12\">Is 7:12</a>."}],"num":"b."}],"num":"3."}],"form":"Pi."}]},"rid":"BDB06353","strong_numbers":["5254"],"next_hw":"מַסָּה⁴","prev_hw":"נְסָה","all_cited":true,"brackets":"first_word","root":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["5814"],"TWOT":["1373"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}